{"_meta":{"openai/outputTemplate":"ui://commerce/trailberg-ireland/complete-look?v=cfacff11926f","openai/toolInvocation/invoked":"Rendered products to complete the look.","openai/toolInvocation/invoking":"Finding products to complete the look\u2026","ui":{"resourceUri":"ui://commerce/trailberg-ireland/complete-look?v=cfacff11926f"},"ui/resourceUri":"ui://commerce/trailberg-ireland/complete-look?v=cfacff11926f"},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Show products that complete the look"},"description":"Use this when a shopper wants Trailberg Ireland products to pair, match, style or wear with a specific product. Render Complete the Look with store-configured complementary products and supplementary items. Examples: 'what can I pair with this?', 'what can I match?', 'suggest a suitable pair', 'suitable matching suggestions', 'recommend matching products', 'what goes well with it?', 'dress to pair with this product', or 'complete this outfit'. Follow-up pairing requests also need this tool when the subject is clear from current-store context; the shopper does not need to say 'Complete the Look' or 'call the tool'. Do not substitute a text-only styling answer for fetching store recommendations. For one subject product, call this tool exactly once. For multiple explicitly named subject products, call it at most once per subject. Do not call it automatically after an ordinary discovery search, and do not additionally open product search or product detail merely to prepare, validate, rank, compare, or explain these recommendations. Pass a known current-store product ID, otherwise the subject's exact title in query; this tool resolves it internally. Do not call product search first merely to resolve the subject. If 'this/it' is ambiguous or no subject is identified, ask which product rather than guessing. General shopping suggestions without a subject belong to render_product_search. If no matching products are configured, explain the returned limitation without inventing pairs or opening another UI.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"buyer_context":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":{"type":"string"},"type":"object"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Buyer Context"},"product_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"description":"Exact Shopify product GID of the subject to match, from a previous current-store result. Prefer this over query; never invent an ID or use a different store's ID.","title":"Product Id"},"query":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"description":"Subject product's exact current-store title, extracted from user wording or prior store context, when product_id is unknown. Example: 'Painter Tee - Black'. Do not pass the whole pairing question, 'this product', or the desired matching category.","title":"Query"}},"title":"render_complete_the_lookArguments","type":"object"},"name":"render_complete_the_look","outputSchema":{"$defs":{"CollectionContract":{"properties":{"handle":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Handle"},"id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Id"},"title":{"title":"Title","type":"string"},"url":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Url"}},"required":["title"],"title":"CollectionContract","type":"object"},"DiscountContract":{"properties":{"display":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Display"},"percentage":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Percentage"}},"title":"DiscountContract","type":"object"},"MoneyContract":{"properties":{"amount":{"title":"Amount","type":"number"},"currency":{"title":"Currency","type":"string"},"display":{"title":"Display","type":"string"}},"required":["amount","currency","display"],"title":"MoneyContract","type":"object"},"PriceContract":{"properties":{"current":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/Mone